    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/7bb8d4fa105f9466a6df65337e57339d.avif?t=1727070275\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/c4014d89f8c2b5c8641a001d04dd4c85.poster.avif?t=1727070275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/c4014d89f8c2b5c8641a001d04dd4c85.webm?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/c4014d89f8c2b5c8641a001d04dd4c85.mp4?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Manny Boxing VR is aimed at realistic Boxing games using virtual reality systems.<br>If you want to enjoy Boxing through VR, Manny Boxing VR will be a choice without regret!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">features</h2></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Boxing play with Manny Pacquiao<br></li><li> Various boxing training modes<br>  - Mitt training ( with Manny )<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/31351c2a8008ccf63ea75de43e81d9e6.poster.avif?t=1727070275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/31351c2a8008ccf63ea75de43e81d9e6.webm?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/31351c2a8008ccf63ea75de43e81d9e6.mp4?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>  - Dummy hitting practice<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/b6b804ba2715e7cfa5262f1d6b7a46c0.poster.avif?t=1727070275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/b6b804ba2715e7cfa5262f1d6b7a46c0.webm?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/b6b804ba2715e7cfa5262f1d6b7a46c0.mp4?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>  - Punching speed ball<br>  - Heavy Bag Training  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/d7b4105b3b37487e5fc56d6486c10c88.poster.avif?t=1727070275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/d7b4105b3b37487e5fc56d6486c10c88.webm?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/d7b4105b3b37487e5fc56d6486c10c88.mp4?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Advanced AI divided by 5 difficulty levels<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/2c434d2bd8b0981e59c7ca09e9e2655a.poster.avif?t=1727070275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/2c434d2bd8b0981e59c7ca09e9e2655a.webm?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/2c434d2bd8b0981e59c7ca09e9e2655a.mp4?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li> Multiplayer boxing in real-time<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/bce3b7977fe20c8b1654bbb046bb7538.poster.avif?t=1727070275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/bce3b7977fe20c8b1654bbb046bb7538.webm?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/bce3b7977fe20c8b1654bbb046bb7538.mp4?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">how to Play</h2></strong></h2><br>Boxing is a Dynamic sport played using gloves to hit opponent in the Boxing ring.<br>Avoiding the opponent's attack, Attack your opponent in various ways.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/c962e4fe6eed718c46061c212dd6f9fc.poster.avif?t=1727070275\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/c962e4fe6eed718c46061c212dd6f9fc.webm?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/803020/extras/c962e4fe6eed718c46061c212dd6f9fc.mp4?t=1727070275\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Challenge the best boxers!",
